            "output": "### Page\n- Page URL: http://127.0.0.1:4173/presentation.html#/2\n- Page Title: Catalyst Router | Alpaca Hackathon\n### Snapshot\n```yaml\n- application [ref=f1e2] [box=0,0,3200,1574]:\n  - generic [box=320,67,2560,1440]:\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=320,67,2560,1440]:\n      - generic [box=878,306,1445,962]:\n        - generic [box=878,306,1445,55]: Alpaca Hackathon 2026\n        - heading [level=1] [box=878,414,1445,420]: Catalyst Router\n        - paragraph [box=878,935,1445,293]: An autonomous paper-trading agent where AI finds a signal and deterministic systems protect the capital.\n      - generic [box=320,1442,1322,47]: XGBoost signals / Alpaca paper trading / Immutable decisions\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=-3520,67,2560,1440]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=-3520,67,2560,55]: The Thesis\n      - heading [level=2] [box=-3520,138,2560,315]: Make the model useful, not all-powerful.\n      - paragraph [box=-3520,537,1982,387]: AI proposes direction and confidence. Deterministic code owns every dollar of risk.\n      - generic [box=-3520,1009,2560,271]:\n        - generic [box=-3520,1009,834,271]:\n          - generic [box=-3479,1039,753,41]: Observe\n          - generic [box=-3479,1092,753,61]: Dynamic universe\n          - generic [box=-3479,1162,753,87]: Liquid equities, IEX prices, and fresh market context.\n        - generic [box=-2657,1009,834,271]:\n          - generic [box=-2617,1039,753,41]: Decide\n          - generic [box=-2617,1092,753,61]: Long / short / abstain\n          - generic [box=-2617,1162,753,44]: XGBoost scores completed 15-minute bars.\n        - generic [box=-1794,1009,834,271]:\n          - generic [box=-1754,1039,753,41]: Govern\n          - generic [box=-1754,1092,753,61]: Risk first\n          - generic [box=-1754,1162,753,87]: The model cannot size, submit, or bypass a veto.\n    - generic [ref=f1e19] [box=320,67,2560,1440]:\n      - heading \"Model Architecture\" [level=3] [ref=f1e20] [box=320,67,2560,55]\n      - heading \"One narrow path to an order.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e21] [box=320,138,2560,157]\n      - document [ref=f1e24] [box=448,359,2304,369]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e26] [box=455,367,2289,354]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e27] [box=455,367,2289,354]\n          - generic [ref=f1e52] [box=1330,465,1171,209]\n          - generic [ref=f1e77] [box=479,399,2243,289]\n      - paragraph [ref=f1e134] [box=320,791,2560,48]: The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order.\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=4160,67,2560,1440]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=4160,67,2560,55]: Alpaca, End To End\n      - heading [level=2] [box=4160,138,2560,315]: Alpaca is the market interface and the source of truth.\n      - generic [box=4160,506,2560,566]:\n        - generic [box=4160,506,1266,269]:\n          - generic [box=4201,537,1184,41]: Market Data API\n          - generic [box=4201,590,1184,61]: IEX bars, quotes, screeners\n          - generic [box=4201,660,1184,44]: Point-in-time model features plus freshness and spread gates.\n        - generic [box=5454,506,1266,269]:\n          - generic [box=5495,537,1184,41]: News API\n          - generic [box=5495,590,1184,61]: Catalyst evidence\n          - generic [box=5495,660,1184,44]: Symbol news feeds a shadow-only Bedrock event extractor.\n        - generic [box=4160,804,1266,269]:\n          - generic [box=4201,834,1184,41]: Paper Trading API\n          - generic [box=4201,887,1184,61]: Brackets and reconciliation\n          - generic [box=4201,957,1184,44]: Broker-hosted exits; account, order, and P&L authority.\n        - generic [box=5454,804,1266,269]:\n          - generic [box=5495,834,1184,41]: alpaca-py + CLI\n          - generic [box=5495,887,1184,61]: Typed runtime and safe demo\n          - generic [box=5495,957,1184,44]: Python worker executes; CLI supports read-only diagnostics and dry runs.\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=4160,67,2560,1440]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=4160,67,2560,55]: Built To Survive\n      - heading [level=2] [box=4160,138,2560,315]: Every trade must earn permission to exist.\n      - generic [box=4160,506,2560,269]:\n        - generic [box=4160,506,834,269]:\n          - generic [box=4201,537,753,41]: Market gates\n          - generic [box=4201,590,753,61]: Freshness, spread, hours\n          - generic [box=4201,660,753,44]: Bad or stale data resolves to no trade.\n        - generic [box=5023,506,834,269]:\n          - generic [box=5063,537,753,41]: Portfolio limits\n          - generic [box=5063,590,753,61]: 1% risk per trade\n          - generic [box=5063,660,753,44]: Six positions max, 5% total stop-risk.\n        - generic [box=5886,506,834,269]:\n          - generic [box=5926,537,753,41]: Failure containment\n          - generic [box=5926,590,753,61]: Brackets + circuit breakers\n          - generic [box=5926,660,753,44]: Risk halt at 4% daily loss; kill at 12% drawdown.\n      - generic [box=4160,813,2560,129]:\n        - paragraph [box=4208,844,2464,66]:\n          - strong [box=4208,848,461,57]: \"Auditable by design:\"\n          - text: immutable decisions, idempotent order claims, and Alpaca reconciliation after every restart.\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=320,67,2560,1440]:\n      - generic [box=886,285,1428,1003]:\n        - generic [box=886,285,1428,55]: Catalyst Router\n        - heading [level=2] [box=886,358,1428,370]: Intelligence with boundaries.\n        - paragraph [box=886,792,1428,245]: We are not asking an LLM to trade. We are building a verifiable system that uses models where they help and controls where they matter.\n        - paragraph [box=886,1094,1428,154]: AI proposes. Deterministic code disposes. Alpaca reconciles.\n  - link \"3 / 7\" [ref=f1e137] [cursor=pointer] [box=3147,1542,40,20]:\n    - /url: \"#/2\"\n  - complementary [box=3192,1566,0,0]:\n    - button \"previous slide\" [ref=f1e138] [cursor=pointer] [box=3101,1516,36,36]\n    - button \"next slide\" [ref=f1e15] [cursor=pointer] [box=3151,1516,36,36]\n  - text: Speaker notes\n  - generic [ref=f1e18] [box=0,0,1,1]: Model Architecture One narrow path to an order. The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order.\n```",
