          "type": "text",
          "text": "## Objective\n- Create a concise Reveal.js pitch deck for Catalyst Router.\n- Restyle it to a professional minimalist design inspired by alpaca.markets.\n\n## Important Details\n- Deck is `presentation.html` at repository root.\n- Presentation is intended for 5 minutes; currently 7 slides.\n- Must include Mermaid model architecture, Alpaca services usage, and editable results/P&L placeholders.\n- Alpaca style direction: signature yellow `#FCD72B`, black typography, off-white surfaces, restrained layout.\n- Existing `README.md` modification was pre-existing and must remain untouched.\n- Alpaca font URLs added:\n  - `https://files.alpaca.markets/fonts/BROmega/stylesheet.css`\n  - `https://files.alpaca.markets/fonts/Formular/stylesheet.css`\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Created `presentation.html` using Reveal.js `@5.1.0` and Mermaid `@11`.\n- Added 7-slide narrative: title, thesis, architecture, Alpaca services, guardrails, results template, closing.\n- Mermaid initialization was fixed to render only on active Reveal slide, avoiding hidden-slide sizing errors.\n- Browser verification previously succeeded with no console errors after Mermaid fix.\n- Applied major CSS restyle toward Alpaca yellow/black/off-white branding.\n- Updated Mermaid theme variables to yellow/black styling.\n- Added `.brand-cover` yellow treatment to first and closing slides.\n- Ran `git diff --check` successfully before current restyle.\n- Removed temporary verification screenshots and stopped local Python server.\n\n### Active\n- `presentation.html` was just patched with Alpaca-inspired styling but has not yet been browser-verified after this latest patch.\n- Active todo state from prior agent:\n  - `Restyle deck with Alpaca brand palette` in progress.\n  - `Verify redesigned deck rendering` pending.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Serve and open `presentation.html` locally, then verify all slides and console errors after the latest CSS/font changes.\n2. Run `git diff --check`; adjust layout/font fallback if Alpaca font URLs fail or slides overflow.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `presentation.html`: Reveal.js deck; contains all content, CSS, Mermaid diagram, CDN imports, and results placeholders.\n- `README.md`: pre-existing modified file; do not alter.\n- `CONTEXT.md`: Catalyst Router domain details.\n- `docs/adr/0011-separate-alpaca-runtime-and-agent-tool-authority.md`: authoritative Alpaca SDK/MCP/CLI integration roles.\n- `docs/adr/0013-authorize-the-model-for-paper-execution.md`: paper-only model authority and deterministic risk constraints.",
