path to an order.\" [level=2] [ref=e5] [box=149,112,1215,82]\n      - document [ref=e8] [box=209,228,1093,235]:\n        - generic [ref=e10] [box=215,234,1082,224]:\n          - generic [ref=e11] [box=215,234,1082,224]\n          - generic [ref=e36] [box=689,300,485,124]\n          - generic [ref=e61] [box=232,257,1049,177]\n      - paragraph [ref=e118] [box=149,497,1215,25]: The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order.\n      - generic \"Deployed model specification\" [ref=e119] [box=149,542,1215,36]:\n        - generic [ref=e120] [box=149,542,296,36]:\n          - strong [ref=e121] [box=156,542,289,20]: \"350\"\n          - text: boosted trees\n        - generic [ref=e122] [box=455,542,297,36]:\n          - strong [ref=e123] [box=462,542,289,20]: \"4\"\n          - text: max depth\n        - generic [ref=e124] [box=761,542,296,36]:\n          - strong [ref=e125] [box=768,542,289,20]: \"16\"\n          - text: point-in-time inputs\n        - generic [ref=e126] [box=1067,542,297,36]:\n          - strong [ref=e127] [box=1074,542,289,20]: 4h\n          - text: prediction horizon\n      - paragraph [ref=e128] [box=285,583,942,41]: \"Regularized binary classifier trained on 12 liquid equities and ETFs. Every completed 15-minute bar produces a probability: long at 52% or higher, short at 48% or lower, otherwise abstain.\"\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=2079,32,1323,744]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=2133,80,1215,25]: Alpaca, End To End\n      - heading [level=2] [box=2133,112,1215,165]: Alpaca is the market interface and the source of truth.\n      - generic [box=2133,304,1215,287]:\n        - generic [box=2133,304,601,137]:\n          - generic [box=2155,320,558,20]: Market Data API\n          - generic [box=2155,346,558,31]: IEX bars, quotes, screeners\n          - generic [box=2155,383,558,22]: Point-in-time model features plus freshness and spread gates.\n        - generic [box=2747,304,601,137]:\n          - generic [box=2768,320,558,20]: News API\n          - generic [box=2768,346,558,31]: Catalyst evidence\n          - generic [box=2768,383,558,22]: Symbol news feeds a shadow-only Bedrock event extractor.\n        - generic [box=2133,453,601,138]:\n          - generic [box=2155,469,558,20]: Paper Trading API\n          - generic [box=2155,495,558,31]: Brackets and reconciliation\n          - generic [box=2155,532,558,22]: Broker-hosted exits; account, order, and P&L authority.\n        - generic [box=2747,453,601,138]:\n          - generic [box=2768,469,558,20]: alpaca-py + CLI\n          - generic [box=2768,495,558,31]: Typed runtime and safe demo\n          - generic [box=2768,532,558,43]: Python worker executes; CLI supports read-only diagnostics and dry runs.\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=2079,32,1323,744]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=2133,80,1215,25]: Built To Survive\n      - heading [level=2] [box=2133,112,1215,165]: Every trade must earn permission to exist.\n      - generic [box=2133,304,1215,170]:\n        - generic [box=2133,304,397,170]:\n          - generic [box=2155,320,354,20]: Market gates\n          - generic [box=2155,346,354,31]: Freshness, spread, hours\n          - generic [box=2155,383,354,22]: Bad or stale data resolves to no trade.\n        - generic [box=2542,304,397,170]:\n          - generic [box=2564,320,354,20]: Portfolio limits\n          - generic [box=2564,346,354,31]: 1% risk per trade\n          - generic [box=2564,383,354,22]: Six positions max, 5% total stop-risk.\n        - generic [box=2951,304,397,170]:\n          - generic [box=2973,320,354,20]: Failure containment\n          - generic [box=2973,346,354,63]: Brackets + circuit breakers\n          - generic [box=2973,414,354,43]: Risk halt at 4% daily loss; kill at 12% drawdown.\n      - generic [box=2133,493,1215,101]:\n        - paragraph [box=2159,510,1164,68]:\n          - strong [box=2159,511,259,31]: \"Auditable by design:\"\n          - text: immutable decisions, idempotent order claims, and Alpaca reconciliation after every restart.\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=94,32,1323,744]:\n      - generic [box=387,130,738,549]:\n        - generic [box=637,151,239,34]: Catalyst Router\n        - heading [level=2] [box=387,194,738,188]: Intelligence with boundaries.\n        - paragraph [box=387,413,738,127]: We are not asking an LLM to trade. We are building a verifiable system that uses models where they help and controls where they matter.\n        - paragraph [box=387,566,738,92]: AI proposes. Deterministic code disposes. Alpaca reconciles.\n  - link \"3 / 7\" [ref=e133] [cursor=pointer] [box=1459,777,40,20]:\n    - /url: \"#/2\"\n  - complementary [box=1504,801,0,0]:\n    - button \"previous slide\" [ref=e134] [cursor=pointer] [box=1413,751,36,36]\n    - button \"next slide\" [ref=e136] [cursor=pointer] [box=1470,751,36,36]\n  - text: Speaker notes\n  - generic [ref=e140] [box=0,0,1,1]: \"Model Architecture One narrow path to an order. The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order. 350 boosted trees 4 max depth 16 point-in-time inputs 4h prediction horizon Regularized binary classifier trained on 12 liquid equities and ETFs. Every completed 15-minute bar produces a probability: long at 52% or higher, short at 48% or lower, otherwise abstain.\"\n```",
