]\n      - paragraph [ref=f3e132] [box=285,575,942,82]: The classifier estimates a positive four-hour move. A probability of 52% or higher indicates enough upside edge for a long position. A probability of 48% or lower indicates the corresponding downside edge for a short position. The 48-52% band abstains from weak signals. This narrow symmetric gate permits more paper trading opportunities while deterministic risk controls retain final authority.\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=2079,32,1323,744]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=2133,80,1215,25]: Alpaca, End To End\n      - heading [level=2] [box=2133,112,1215,165]: Alpaca is the market interface and the source of truth.\n      - generic [box=2133,304,1215,287]:\n        - generic [box=2133,304,601,137]\n        - generic [box=2747,304,601,137]\n        - generic [box=2133,453,601,138]\n        - generic [box=2747,453,601,138]\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=2079,32,1323,744]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=2133,80,1215,25]: Built To Survive\n      - heading [level=2] [box=2133,112,1215,165]: Every trade must earn permission to exist.\n      - generic [box=2133,304,1215,170]:\n        - generic [box=2133,304,397,170]\n        - generic [box=2542,304,397,170]\n        - generic [box=2951,304,397,170]\n      - generic [box=2133,493,1215,101]:\n        - paragraph [box=2159,510,1164,68]\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=94,32,1323,744]:\n      - generic [box=387,130,738,549]:\n        - generic [box=637,151,239,34]: Catalyst Router\n        - heading [level=2] [box=387,194,738,188]: Intelligence with boundaries.\n        - paragraph [box=387,413,738,127]: We are not asking an LLM to trade. We are building a verifiable system that uses models where they help and controls where they matter.\n        - paragraph [box=387,566,738,92]: AI proposes. Deterministic code disposes. Alpaca reconciles.\n  - link \"3 / 7\" [ref=f3e137] [cursor=pointer] [box=1459,777,40,20]:\n    - /url: \"#/2\"\n  - complementary [box=1504,801,0,0]:\n    - button \"previous slide\" [ref=f3e138] [cursor=pointer] [box=1413,751,36,36]\n    - button \"next slide\" [ref=f3e140] [cursor=pointer] [box=1463,751,36,36]\n  - text: Speaker notes\n  - generic [ref=f3e144] [box=0,0,1,1]: Model Architecture One narrow path to an order. The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order. Boosted trees 350 Max depth 4 Point-in-time inputs 16 Prediction horizon 4h The classifier estimates a positive four-hour move. A probability of 52% or higher indicates enough upside edge for a long position. A probability of 48% or lower indicates the corresponding downside edge for a short position. The 48-52% band abstains from weak signals. This narrow symmetric gate permits more paper trading opportunities while deterministic risk controls retain final authority.\n```",
