            "output": "### Page\n- Page URL: http://127.0.0.1:4173/presentation.html?v=5#/2\n- Page Title: Catalyst Router | Alpaca Hackathon\n### Snapshot\n```yaml\n- application [ref=e2] [box=0,0,3200,1630]:\n  - generic [box=320,95,2560,1440]:\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=320,95,2560,1440]:\n      - generic [box=911,315,1378,999]:\n        - generic [box=911,356,631,66]: Alpaca Hackathon 2026\n        - heading [level=1] [box=911,474,1378,423]: Catalyst Router\n        - paragraph [box=911,996,1378,279]: An autonomous paper-trading agent where AI finds a signal and deterministic systems protect the capital.\n      - generic [box=361,1466,1340,43]: XGBoost signals / Alpaca paper trading / Immutable decisions\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=-3520,95,2560,1440]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=-3415,187,2350,48]: The Thesis\n      - heading [level=2] [box=-3415,248,2350,319]: Make the model useful, not all-powerful.\n      - paragraph [box=-3415,638,1853,348]: AI proposes direction and confidence. Deterministic code owns every dollar of risk.\n      - generic [box=-3415,1058,2350,268]:\n        - generic [box=-3415,1058,768,268]\n        - generic [box=-2624,1058,768,268]\n        - generic [box=-1833,1058,768,268]\n    - generic [ref=e3] [box=320,95,2560,1440]:\n      - heading \"Model Architecture\" [level=3] [ref=e4] [box=425,187,2350,48]\n      - heading \"One narrow path to an order.\" [level=2] [ref=e5] [box=425,248,2350,159]\n      - document [ref=e8] [box=543,474,2115,321]:\n        - generic [ref=e10] [box=548,479,2104,310]\n      - paragraph [ref=e118] [box=425,860,2350,48]: The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order.\n      - generic \"Deployed model specification\" [ref=e119] [box=425,948,2350,102]:\n        - generic [ref=e120] [box=425,948,574,102]\n        - generic [ref=e123] [box=1017,948,574,102]\n        - generic [ref=e126] [box=1609,948,574,102]\n        - generic [ref=e129] [box=2201,948,574,102]\n      - paragraph [ref=e132] [box=689,1070,1823,159]: The classifier estimates a positive four-hour move. A probability of 52% or higher indicates enough upside edge for a long position. A probability of 48% or lower indicates the corresponding downside edge for a short position. The 48-52% band abstains from weak signals. This narrow symmetric gate permits more paper trading opportunities while deterministic risk controls retain final authority.\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=4160,95,2560,1440]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=4265,187,2350,48]: Alpaca, End To End\n      - heading [level=2] [box=4265,248,2350,319]: Alpaca is the market interface and the source of truth.\n      - generic [box=4265,620,2350,556]:\n        - generic [box=4265,620,1163,265]\n        - generic [box=5452,620,1163,265]\n        - generic [box=4265,908,1163,268]\n        - generic [box=5452,908,1163,268]\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=4160,95,2560,1440]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=4265,187,2350,48]: Built To Survive\n      - heading [level=2] [box=4265,248,2350,319]: Every trade must earn permission to exist.\n      - generic [box=4265,620,2350,328]:\n        - generic [box=4265,620,768,328]\n        - generic [box=5056,620,768,328]\n        - generic [box=5847,620,768,328]\n      - generic [box=4265,986,2350,196]:\n        - paragraph [box=4314,1019,2252,132]\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=320,95,2560,1440]:\n      - generic [box=886,284,1428,1062]:\n        - generic [box=1369,325,462,66]: Catalyst Router\n        - heading [level=2] [box=886,408,1428,363]: Intelligence with boundaries.\n        - paragraph [box=886,831,1428,245]: We are not asking an LLM to trade. We are building a verifiable system that uses models where they help and controls where they matter.\n        - paragraph [box=886,1128,1428,178]: AI proposes. Deterministic code disposes. Alpaca reconciles.\n  - link \"3 / 7\" [ref=e137] [cursor=pointer] [box=3147,1598,40,20]:\n    - /url: \"#/2\"\n  - complementary [box=3192,1622,0,0]:\n    - button \"previous slide\" [ref=e138] [cursor=pointer] [box=3101,1572,36,36]\n    - button \"next slide\" [ref=e140] [cursor=pointer] [box=3151,1572,36,36]\n  - text: Speaker notes\n  - generic [ref=e144] [box=0,0,1,1]: Model Architecture One narrow path to an order. The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order. Boosted trees 350 Max depth 4 Point-in-time inputs 16 Prediction horizon 4h The classifier estimates a positive four-hour move. A probability of 52% or higher indicates enough upside edge for a long position. A probability of 48% or lower indicates the corresponding downside edge for a short position. The 48-52% band abstains from weak signals. This narrow symmetric gate permits more paper trading opportunities while deterministic risk controls retain final authority.\n```",
