            "output": "### Page\n- Page URL: http://127.0.0.1:4173/presentation.html?v=7#/2\n- Page Title: Catalyst Router | Alpaca Hackathon\n### Snapshot\n```yaml\n- application [ref=f2e2] [box=0,0,1512,809]:\n  - generic [box=94,32,1323,744]:\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=94,32,1323,744]:\n      - generic [box=400,146,712,516]:\n        - generic [box=400,167,326,34]: Alpaca Hackathon 2026\n        - heading [level=1] [box=400,228,712,219]: Catalyst Router\n        - paragraph [box=400,498,712,144]: An autonomous paper-trading agent where AI finds a signal and deterministic systems protect the capital.\n      - generic [box=116,741,693,22]: XGBoost signals / Alpaca paper trading / Immutable decisions\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=-1890,32,1323,744]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=-1836,80,1215,25]: The Thesis\n      - heading [level=2] [box=-1836,112,1215,165]: Make the model useful, not all-powerful.\n      - paragraph [box=-1836,313,958,180]: AI proposes direction and confidence. Deterministic code owns every dollar of risk.\n      - generic [box=-1836,530,1215,138]:\n        - generic [box=-1836,530,397,138]\n        - generic [box=-1427,530,397,138]\n        - generic [box=-1018,530,397,138]\n    - generic [ref=f2e3] [box=94,32,1323,744]:\n      - heading \"Model Architecture\" [level=3] [ref=f2e4] [box=149,80,1215,25]\n      - heading \"One narrow path to an order.\" [level=2] [ref=f2e5] [box=149,112,1215,82]\n      - document [ref=f2e8] [box=209,228,1093,201]:\n        - generic [ref=f2e10] [box=215,234,1081,189]\n      - paragraph [ref=f2e96] [box=149,463,1215,25]: The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order.\n      - generic \"Deployed model specification\" [ref=f2e97] [box=149,508,1215,53]:\n        - generic [ref=f2e98] [box=149,508,296,53]\n        - generic [ref=f2e101] [box=455,508,297,53]\n        - generic [ref=f2e104] [box=761,508,296,53]\n        - generic [ref=f2e107] [box=1067,508,297,53]\n      - paragraph [ref=f2e110] [box=285,572,942,82]: The classifier estimates a positive four-hour move. A probability of 52% or higher indicates enough upside edge for a long position. A probability of 48% or lower indicates the corresponding downside edge for a short position. The 48-52% band abstains from weak signals. This narrow symmetric gate permits more paper trading opportunities while deterministic risk controls retain final authority.\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=2079,32,1323,744]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=2133,80,1215,25]: Alpaca, End To End\n      - heading [level=2] [box=2133,112,1215,165]: Alpaca is the market interface and the source of truth.\n      - generic [box=2133,304,1215,287]:\n        - generic [box=2133,304,601,137]\n        - generic [box=2747,304,601,137]\n        - generic [box=2133,453,601,138]\n        - generic [box=2747,453,601,138]\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=2079,32,1323,744]:\n      - heading [level=3] [box=2133,80,1215,25]: Built To Survive\n      - heading [level=2] [box=2133,112,1215,165]: Every trade must earn permission to exist.\n      - generic [box=2133,304,1215,170]:\n        - generic [box=2133,304,397,170]\n        - generic [box=2542,304,397,170]\n        - generic [box=2951,304,397,170]\n      - generic [box=2133,493,1215,101]:\n        - paragraph [box=2159,510,1164,68]\n    - generic [aria-hidden] [box=94,32,1323,744]:\n      - generic [box=387,130,738,549]:\n        - generic [box=637,151,239,34]: Catalyst Router\n        - heading [level=2] [box=387,194,738,188]: Intelligence with boundaries.\n        - paragraph [box=387,413,738,127]: We are not asking an LLM to trade. We are building a verifiable system that uses models where they help and controls where they matter.\n        - paragraph [box=387,566,738,92]: AI proposes. Deterministic code disposes. Alpaca reconciles.\n  - link \"3 / 7\" [ref=f2e115] [cursor=pointer] [box=1459,777,40,20]:\n    - /url: \"#/2\"\n  - complementary [box=1504,801,0,0]:\n    - button \"previous slide\" [ref=f2e116] [cursor=pointer] [box=1413,751,36,36]\n    - button \"next slide\" [ref=f2e118] [cursor=pointer] [box=1463,751,36,36]\n  - text: Speaker notes\n  - generic [ref=f2e122] [box=0,0,1,1]: Model Architecture One narrow path to an order. The XGBoost model can propose a trade. Only the Risk Governor can approve an Alpaca order. Boosted trees 350 Max depth 4 Point-in-time inputs 16 Prediction horizon 4h The classifier estimates a positive four-hour move. A probability of 52% or higher indicates enough upside edge for a long position. A probability of 48% or lower indicates the corresponding downside edge for a short position. The 48-52% band abstains from weak signals. This narrow symmetric gate permits more paper trading opportunities while deterministic risk controls retain final authority.\n```",
